1
00:00:00,550 --> 00:00:07,213
Construction CRM turns project work into a small construction site, with you as the engineer.

2
00:00:07,433 --> 00:00:13,167
You commission work, watch its evidence, and decide when a milestone is complete.

3
00:00:14,687 --> 00:00:22,545
The demo page plays recorded sample events. Switch between Build and Operate, or drag the replay slider.

4
00:00:22,765 --> 00:00:27,334
This preview starts no coding tasks and makes no AI calls.

5
00:00:28,854 --> 00:00:33,863
To use the working app, open PowerShell in the extracted source folder.

6
00:00:34,083 --> 00:00:41,901
Run npm run doctor, then npm start. Keep this terminal open and open its dashboard address.

7
00:00:43,421 --> 00:00:47,744
Click Connect and paste the local owner token printed in that terminal.

8
00:00:47,964 --> 00:00:54,128
This is your dashboard token. Keep HubSpot and GHL credentials on the server.

9
00:00:55,648 --> 00:01:00,486
Give the project a name and enter the absolute folder path containing its code.

10
00:01:00,706 --> 00:01:07,600
For your first experiment, set Maximum model task starts to one, then register the project.

11
00:01:09,120 --> 00:01:16,058
Enter a clear task, such as improving empty email validation while keeping valid submissions working.

12
00:01:16,278 --> 00:01:23,941
Choose a crew role, an available model, installed skills, and a milestone. Then commission and start.

13
00:01:25,461 --> 00:01:32,285
The work order moves through running and verification. Select Inspect to examine the task evidence.

14
00:01:32,505 --> 00:01:39,198
One model task runs by default. The worker animation itself uses no AI calls.

15
00:01:40,718 --> 00:01:46,731
If a permission request appears, read the exact command or file change before deciding.

16
00:01:46,951 --> 00:01:54,000
Approve only that action, or decline. An approval does not grant permission for the whole session.

17
00:01:55,520 --> 00:02:03,023
Review the changed files and any configured checks. Passing checks and your acceptance complete the milestone.

18
00:02:03,243 --> 00:02:08,901
In the work orders table, choose Accept work only when the result meets your criteria.

19
00:02:10,421 --> 00:02:18,474
After the hosted backend is configured, Operate shows enquiries, HubSpot delivery, consultations, and reviews.

20
00:02:18,694 --> 00:02:26,687
A consultation can be confirmed while CRM delivery is retrying. Customers use your hosted enquiry page.

21
00:02:28,207 --> 00:02:34,586
Start locally, register a project, and commission one small, reviewable task.

22
00:02:34,806 --> 00:02:45,324
Hosted deployment, the always on model, GHL key rotation, and owner acceptance remain pending. The installation guide explains setup.

